# Both images - the dev container (.devcontainer/Dockerfile) and the plain container (Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml) -
# are built with the project root as context. Send only what the builds need: never the statements, the database in
# data/, .env, .venv or .git. Allow-list: everything is excluded (*), the files below are let through again.
*
# dev container: Python environment
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
# plain container: the application and its start script
!app.py
!ibkr_tracker
!.streamlit/config.toml
!docker/entrypoint.sh
# ... but no byte code of the host's Python
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
